# Copilot:  Create a comprehensive .gitignore for a project with:
# - Python (FastAPI, scripts, virtual environments)
# - Node.js / React / Vite (frontend)
# - Terraform (infrastructure as code)
# - Azure (cloud services)
# - Environment variables and secrets (. env, keys, certificates)
# - IDEs (VS Code, PyCharm)
# - OS files (macOS, Windows, Linux)
# - Logs and temporary files
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
